# Copy this file to ".env" and fill in your own values.
# The .env file is git-ignored so your credentials stay local.
#
# 1. Turn on 2-Step Verification for your Google account.
# 2. Create an App Password here:  https://myaccount.google.com/apppasswords
#    (choose "Mail" / "Other"). Google gives you a 16-character code.
# 3. Make sure IMAP is enabled: Gmail > Settings > Forwarding and POP/IMAP.


